{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53331","headline":"诗偈 四十二 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 四十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"菩提般若名相假，湼盘真如亦是虚。\n欲得心神真解脱，一切名相本来无。\n十方世界风尘净，州州县县绝艰虞。\n王道荡荡无偏党，举国衆生同一如。\n不动干戈安万姓，法王合掌髻中珠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53331.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53331","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}